---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - JKSPDC"
  description="Privacy Policy for the official JKSPDC website. Information on data collection, cookies, third-party services, and your rights."
>
  <div class="space-y-0 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="page-header-band animate-fadeInUp">
      <nav class="breadcrumb-trail" aria-label="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="separator" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span class="current">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL)</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6">
      <article class="w-full prose-gov space-y-5">

        <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg p-4 text-xs text-amber-800 font-semibold flex items-start gap-2">
          <Icon name="alert-triangle" size={14} class="text-amber-800 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
          <span><strong>DRAFT — FOR JKSPDC LEGAL REVIEW AND FORMAL APPROVAL BEFORE PUBLICATION.</strong></span>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p>Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL) is committed to protecting your privacy and handling personal data responsibly and in accordance with applicable laws. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, store, and protect information when you use our official website.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We collect the following categories of information:</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-sm text-gray-800 mt-3 mb-1">2.1 Information You Provide Voluntarily</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
            <li>• Name, email address, and message when you submit a contact inquiry or feedback form</li>
            <li>• Information submitted when applying for careers/recruitment</li>
          </ul>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-sm text-gray-800 mt-3 mb-1">2.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
            <li>• Browser type, operating system, IP address (for security and analytics purposes)</li>
            <li>• Pages visited, time spent, and referral URL (aggregate, anonymised analytics)</li>
          </ul>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-sm text-gray-800 mt-3 mb-1">2.3 Browser Storage (Cookies &amp; LocalStorage)</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
            <li>• <strong>Accessibility preferences</strong> — Font size setting and high contrast mode preference (stored in localStorage; not transmitted)</li>
            <li>• <strong>Language preference</strong> — Selected display language (stored in localStorage; not transmitted)</li>
            <li>• <strong>Translation cache</strong> — Translated text cache via Bhashini API (stored in localStorage; not transmitted externally)</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">We do not use third-party advertising cookies or tracking pixels.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-sm">
            <li>• To respond to your inquiries and feedback</li>
            <li>• To improve the quality and accessibility of this Website</li>
            <li>• To monitor security and prevent unauthorised access</li>
            <li>• To comply with legal and regulatory obligations</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or share your personal information with any commercial third party.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>This Website uses the following third-party services:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm mt-2">
            <li>
              <strong>Google Fonts</strong> — Used to load the Noto Sans typeface. Font requests are sent to Google servers. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#0B4F9C] hover:underline">Google's Privacy Policy<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Bhashini Translation API (MeitY, Government of India)</strong> — Used to provide Hindi, Urdu, Kashmiri, and Dogri translations. Text is transmitted to Bhashini servers for translation when language switching is used. See Bhashini's privacy policy at <a href="https://bhashini.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#0B4F9C] hover:underline">bhashini.gov.in<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">5. Data Retention</h2>
          <p>Contact form and feedback submissions are retained for a period necessary to process and respond to them, after which they may be archived in accordance with Government document retention policies. Browser-stored accessibility preferences are retained locally and can be cleared by the user at any time through their browser settings.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">6. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm mt-2">
            <li>• Access information held about you</li>
            <li>• Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
            <li>• Request deletion of your submitted contact/feedback data</li>
            <li>• Withdraw consent for processing where applicable</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:md-jkspdcl@jk.gov.in" class="text-[#0B4F9C] hover:underline">md-jkspdcl[at]jk[dot]gov[dot]in</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">7. Security</h2>
          <p>We implement appropriate technical and organisational security measures to protect your information against unauthorised access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. The Website uses HTTPS encryption for all data transmission.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">8. Changes to this Policy</h2>
          <p>This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically. Changes will be published on this page with a revised effective date.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">9. Contact</h2>
          <div class="text-sm space-y-1">
            <p><strong>Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited</strong></p>
            <p>Exhibition Grounds, Jahangir Chowk, Srinagar — 190009</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:md-jkspdcl@jk.gov.in" class="text-[#0B4F9C] hover:underline">md-jkspdcl[at]jk[dot]gov[dot]in</a></p>
            <p>Phone: +91 194 2451665</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-4">
          <strong>Effective Date:</strong> August 2026 | <strong>Last Reviewed:</strong> {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long' })}
        </p>

      </article>


    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
